, rather than implementing cost savings initiatives over the life of the program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/lear-lea-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q1","e":"lea","d":"2026-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond E. Scott","x":"Restructuring savings from last year's investments combined with actions planned for this year are expected to total $80 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/lear-lea-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q1","e":"lea","d":"2026-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason M. Cardew","x":"Slide 16 reaffirms our outlook for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/lear-lea-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q1","e":"lea","d":"2026-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason M. Cardew","x":"…the overall global macro environment and potential impacts from the conflict in the Middle East, we felt it was prudent to simply maintain our full-year outlook at this time, essentially protecting for the risk of these events impacting global industry production in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/lear-lea-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Raymond E. Scott Jr.","x":"And so the importance of what we have been investing in over the last 10 years around digital AI tools and automation could not be more important and critical to how our growth is.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"Improvement was partially driven by a reduction in inventories, as our Idea by Lear initiatives continue to improve inventory management as well as from the timing of tariff payments and recoveries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"Our current outlook assumes no changes to current tariff policies or significant industry-wide disruptions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"We increased our revenue midpoint by approximately $165 million driven by higher production volumes and Lear programs, favorable foreign exchange and commodity pass-through impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond E. Scott Jr.","x":"Restructuring savings from last year's investments combined with actions this year are expected to total $80 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"The reduction in operating income reflects the expected impact from lower volumes on Lear platforms partially offset by strong net performance driven by Idea initiatives, restructuring savings, and commercial negotiations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Raymond E. Scott Jr.","x":"Our strong first half has given us confidence to raise full-year guidance for revenue, operating income and free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q2","e":"lea","d":"2026-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"Our strong financial results in the first half of the year give us confidence to increase our 2026 outlook for net sales, core operating earnings, and free cash flow from the midpoint of our prior outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/03/lear-lea-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q3","e":"lea","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"Year to date, operating cash flow is higher compared to 2025, driven by improvements in inventory management through our Idea by Lear initiatives, as well as the timing of tariff payments, and recoveries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/lear-lea-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q3","e":"lea","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jared Fidale","x":"Our current outlook assumes no changes to current tariff policies or significant industry wide disruptions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/lear-lea-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q3","e":"lea","d":"2026-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jared Fidale","x":"We reduced our revenue midpoint by approximately $225 million driven by lower production volumes on Lear programs particularly in China, and the impact of foreign exchange partially offset by increasing supplier pass through due to the rising commodity costs and commercial recoveries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/lear-lea-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q3","e":"lea","d":"2026-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Cardew","x":"And so the vast majority of that has been passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/lear-lea-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LEA 2026 Q3","e":"lea","d":"2026-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond E. Sco